  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the UNDP governance programme 2004-2007 are to strengthen the democratic governance in Honduras and to promote sustainable human development. The programme include project support to political and electoral reform, to defense sector reform, citizen security and justice, and land titling and registration of land in the Municipality of Tegucigalpa.</narrative>
